Europe: A powerhouse in aerospace manufacturing, Europe holds a significant portion of the market, driven by the presence of Airbus and a network of leading tier-one suppliers.
Asia-Pacific: This is the fastest-growing regional market, driven by the rapid expansion of airline fleets, the establishment of new MRO facilities, and growing domestic aviation markets in countries like China and India.
Rest of the World: Regions such as Latin America and the Middle East & Africa represent emerging markets with considerable long-term potential as their aviation infrastructures continue to develop.
